                        //   [ESP+4]  009C43E3  approach+B4h, the attack distance
                        //   [ESP+8]  009C43DB  approach+BCh, the LIVE planar range
                        //   [ESP+Ch] 009C43CD  the InterpolateClamped result
                        //
