                        // subtracts at 0099DEB8. It used to be
                        // pose_heading_radians, a bare atan2 over pose row 2,
                        // which is the producer of the SHIP field unit+1050h.
                        // Both reduce to atan2(fx, fz) on a well-formed pose, so
